// Dialog :
"P1699732009" "This letter was meant to be read only by me. It says the Carnival came in and grabbed our client, Richard Thornbrush. Says they ran him ragged and then dumped him at sea. According to this, Ruby and Belle made it out of there alive, but they're scared of the Carnival and don't want to resurface. I don't blame them."
// RandomFameString :
"P1647834826" "It looks like {VillainName}'s after the Carnival."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1223473977" "It sounds like my girls are running scared from the Carnival. Well, I'm not about to write them off. Especially not with Hardcase looking over my shoulder. We're going to find out where they're hiding and bring them back home. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>To start with, I need you to check out an old hideout where Ruby used to stay before I got her off the streets.</a> Maybe you can find something there."
// AcceptString :
"P391993515" "Check out Ruby's old hideout"
// SendOffString :
"P3999412556" "I'll have enough trouble covering up my missing client. If I can find Ruby and Belle, it'll be a lot easier."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1540270725" "I need to find out what's happened to my girls."

